    "wq-1": {
      "id": "wq-1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Humans file requests on a prompt in the Prompt UI. Each request is an annotation pinned to a node, a text range, or the whole prompt. You change the prompt on behalf of the human who owns it. "
        },
        {
          "insert": "prompts_guidance",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " serves this page as topic "
        },
        {
          "insert": "work-requests",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": "."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-2": {
      "id": "wq-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Request Tools"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-3": {
      "id": "wq-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Two tools read and answer requests. Both answers need a task from "
        },
        {
          "insert": "prompts_begin",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " and the latest annotations hash, and each call returns the next "
        },
        {
          "insert": "expected_hash",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": "."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-4": {
      "id": "wq-4",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "prompts_requests",
          "attributes": {
            "bold": true,
            "code": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        "wq-5",
        "wq-6"
      ]
    },
    "wq-5": {
      "id": "wq-5",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Call it first when you are asked to work a prompt's requests."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-6": {
      "id": "wq-6",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "It lists the open requests and the hash to pass as "
        },
        {
          "insert": "expected_hash",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": "."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-7": {
      "id": "wq-7",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "prompts_request_reply",
          "attributes": {
            "bold": true,
            "code": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        "wq-8",
        "wq-9"
      ]
    },
    "wq-8": {
      "id": "wq-8",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Call it when a request is ambiguous, to ask one question on its thread. The request stays open."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-9": {
      "id": "wq-9",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Call it with "
        },
        {
          "insert": "close: true",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " after the request's edit is saved, or to decline it. "
        },
        {
          "insert": "body",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " is then the one-sentence resolution."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-10": {
      "id": "wq-10",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Work the Queue"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-11": {
      "id": "wq-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The prompt is a tree of identified nodes, and its rendered Markdown is a projection you never touch. Valid edits save at once, so the human reviews them in the prompt's history."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-12": {
      "id": "wq-12",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {
        "ordered": true
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Survey the queue."
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        "wq-12a",
        "wq-13",
        "wq-14",
        "wq-15"
      ]
    },
    "wq-12a": {
      "id": "wq-12a",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Call "
        },
        {
          "insert": "prompts_begin",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", and read every part of topic "
        },
        {
          "insert": "standards",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " with its "
        },
        {
          "insert": "task_id",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " before you apply an edit."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-13": {
      "id": "wq-13",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Call "
        },
        {
          "insert": "prompts_requests",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " and read every request: its target, body, and replies."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-14": {
      "id": "wq-14",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Call "
        },
        {
          "insert": "prompts_read",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " for the current tree, the stamped node IDs, and the hash."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-15": {
      "id": "wq-15",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Note requests that touch the same nodes, and work them in the order they were filed."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-16": {
      "id": "wq-16",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {
        "ordered": true
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Work each request against the current tree."
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        "wq-17",
        "wq-21",
        "wq-22",
        "wq-23",
        "wq-24"
      ]
    },
    "wq-17": {
      "id": "wq-17",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Read the target of the request."
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        "wq-18",
        "wq-19",
        "wq-20"
      ]
    },
    "wq-18": {
      "id": "wq-18",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "A "
        },
        {
          "insert": "prompt-node",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " target names one node."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-19": {
      "id": "wq-19",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "A "
        },
        {
          "insert": "prompt-range",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " target names a quoted span inside one node."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-20": {
      "id": "wq-20",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "A target whose node ID equals the document ID is about the whole prompt."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-21": {
      "id": "wq-21",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "If a request is ambiguous, ask with "
        },
        {
          "insert": "prompts_request_reply",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", leave it open, and keep working the others."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-22": {
      "id": "wq-22",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "If a change is needed, apply one minimal batch with "
        },
        {
          "insert": "prompts_apply_ops",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " for that request, then run "
        },
        {
          "insert": "prompts_check",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " with "
        },
        {
          "insert": "task_id",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " and repair each required finding. If no change is needed, apply none."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-23": {
      "id": "wq-23",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Close each request on its own with "
        },
        {
          "insert": "prompts_request_reply",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " and "
        },
        {
          "insert": "close: true",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", after its check passes. Say what changed or why nothing changed."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-24": {
      "id": "wq-24",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Repeat until no request remains that you can close."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-25": {
      "id": "wq-25",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {
        "ordered": true
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Close out the queue."
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        "wq-26",
        "wq-27",
        "wq-28"
      ]
    },
    "wq-26": {
      "id": "wq-26",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Call "
        },
        {
          "insert": "prompts_requests",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " again. Close every request you could close one by one, never as a lump."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-27": {
      "id": "wq-27",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Every request left open must carry an unanswered question whose answer changes the edit."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-28": {
      "id": "wq-28",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Run "
        },
        {
          "insert": "prompts_check",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " with "
        },
        {
          "insert": "task_id",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": "."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-29": {
      "id": "wq-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "When a batch fails validation, narrow it to repair the failure and apply it again. Never widen the edit."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-30": {
      "id": "wq-30",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Rules for Every Edit"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-31": {
      "id": "wq-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "These rules keep each edit small, structural, and true to the prompt."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-32": {
      "id": "wq-32",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Propose structure, never prose."
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        "wq-33"
      ]
    },
    "wq-33": {
      "id": "wq-33",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "An edit is a batch of ID-relative operations, never rewritten Markdown."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-34": {
      "id": "wq-34",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Use the fewest operations that satisfy the request."
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        "wq-35",
        "wq-36"
      ]
    },
    "wq-35": {
      "id": "wq-35",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Touch nothing the request did not name."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-36": {
      "id": "wq-36",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Prefer "
        },
        {
          "insert": "update_node",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " over remove and insert, because removal destroys IDs."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-37": {
      "id": "wq-37",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Change nodes in place, because IDs anchor requests and undo."
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        "wq-38"
      ]
    },
    "wq-38": {
      "id": "wq-38",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Keep every variable placeholder declared."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-39": {
      "id": "wq-39",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Match the prompt's voice and names."
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        "wq-40"
      ]
    },
    "wq-40": {
      "id": "wq-40",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Change style only when a request asks for style."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-41": {
      "id": "wq-41",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Never silently follow a conflicting request."
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        "wq-42",
        "wq-43"
      ]
    },
    "wq-42": {
      "id": "wq-42",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Name the conflict, then narrow or decline it."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-43": {
      "id": "wq-43",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "State any assumption in the resolution."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-44": {
      "id": "wq-44",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Write Replies and Resolutions"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-45": {
      "id": "wq-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Write tersely. Replies and resolutions are a sentence or two, never a restatement of the diff."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-46": {
      "id": "wq-46",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The In-App Editor"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-47": {
      "id": "wq-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The in-app prompt editor works the same queue with its own tools. Topic "
        },
        {
          "insert": "editor",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " holds its state reference and its tool guide."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "wq-48": {
      "id": "wq-48",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The "
        },
        {
          "insert": "R",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " aliases and compact target strings exist only in the editor. With MCP tools, pass a request's "
        },
        {
          "insert": "id",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " from "
        },
        {
          "insert": "prompts_requests",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " as "
        },
        {
          "insert": "request_id",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": "."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
